sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Page
  participant A as ask.ask
  participant L as Haiku (select_slots)
  participant R as rules.apply
  B->>A: POST /ask with text, dates now pickable, halves, draft token
  A->>A: stored poll or valid draft token, text up to 280 chars
  A->>A: rolling windows: 60 per poll, 60 per IP, 120 all, per hour
  A->>L: prompt with dates, holidays, resolved relative days
  L-->>A: reading, ordered rules, split, crop
  A->>R: rules and the page's dates
  R-->>A: slots, count of dropped invalid rules
  A->>A: fold to whole days unless split, clip to crop
  A-->>B: slots, reading, dropped, crop, split
  B->>B: clamp to its own offer, replace grid, nothing stored or signed
